l":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"requested_reviewer":{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"sha":"733fc40c3d9f4ae983f38f9f2e4fc9983fe81ef4","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDczM2ZjNDBjM2Q5ZjRhZTk4M2YzOGY5ZjJlNGZjOTk4M2ZlODFlZjQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/733fc40c3d9f4ae983f38f9f2e4fc9983fe81ef4","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/733fc40c3d9f4ae983f38f9f2e4fc9983fe81ef4","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-10-27T10:20:55Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kristoffer@tailscale.com","date":"2025-10-27T10:34:13Z"},"tree":{"sha":"d8c96839d022ac7e6ad807aaad971b431fa39c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/d8c96839d022ac7e6ad807aaad971b431fa39c51"},"message":"debug: add /debug/http-routes endpoint\n\nAdd new debug endpoint to list all registered HTTP routes with their\nmethods and optional names. This helps with debugging and understanding\nthe API surface area.\n\nThe endpoint supports both text and JSON formats:\n\nText format (default):\n```\n=== Registered HTTP Routes ===\n\n/api/v1/                                          [ALL]\n/apple                                            [GET]\n/health                                           [GET]\n/register/{registration_id}                       [GET]\n/ts2021                                           [POST, GET]\n\nTotal routes: 14\n```\n\nJSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/health\",\n      \"methods\": [\"GET\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/ts2021\",\n      \"methods\": [\"POST\", \"GET\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_count\": 14\n}\n```\n\nUsage:\n- Text: curl http://localhost:9090/debug/http-routes\n- JSON: curl -H \"Accept: application/json\" http://localhost:9090/debug/http-routes\n\nChanges:\n- Modified debugHTTPServer() to accept router parameter\n- Added collectRoutes() to walk router and collect route information\n- Added debugHTTPRoutes() for text output\n- Added debugHTTPRoutesJSON() for structured output\n- Added HTTPRouteInfo and DebugHTTPRoutesInfo types\n- Added unit tests for route listing functionality","parents":[{"sha":"e68e2288f799011983da4c275c3230bfdaaa9a0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/e68e2288f799011983da4c275c3230bfdaaa9a0b","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/e68e2288f799011983da4c275c3230bfdaaa9a0b"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgmMAoz5Zf+w0nAxyA6/zsNd95cP\n98YbtHIIXyy9A1sssAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQO1YhIujvGt+7Ow5mf2u03Jsn9t7X85No/4HrwmWm513IapgpsglXssnWpfhI7o8wU\nc3uzvRYodWKxUq9r06Xgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree d8c96839d022ac7e6ad807aaad971b431fa39c51\nparent e68e2288f799011983da4c275c3230bfdaaa9a0b\nauthor Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1761560455 +0100\ncommitter Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com> 1761561253 +0100\n\ndebug: add /debug/http-routes endpoint\n\nAdd new debug endpoint to list all registered HTTP routes with their\nmethods and optional names. This helps with debugging and understanding\nthe API surface area.\n\nThe endpoint supports both text and JSON formats:\n\nText format (default):\n```\n=== Registered HTTP Routes ===\n\n/api/v1/                                          [ALL]\n/apple                                            [GET]\n/health                                           [GET]\n/register/{registration_id}                       [GET]\n/ts2021                                           [POST, GET]\n\nTotal routes: 14\n```\n\nJSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"routes\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/health\",\n      \"methods\": [\"GET\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"/ts2021\",\n      \"methods\": [\"POST\", \"GET\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total_count\": 14\n}\n```\n\nUsage:\n- Text: curl http://localhost:9090/debug/http-routes\n- JSON: curl -H \"Accept: application/json\" http://localhost:9090/debug/http-routes\n\nChanges:\n- Modified debugHTTPServer() to accept router parameter\n- Added collectRoutes() to walk router and collect route information\n- Added debugHTTPRoutes() for text output\n- Added debugHTTPRoutesJSON() for structured output\n- Added HTTPRouteInfo and DebugHTTPRoutesInfo types\n- Added unit tests for route listing functionality\n","verified_at":"2025-10-27T10:34:24Z"},"event":"committed"},{"id":20521511460,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887T9ZavzwAAAATHLWok","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/20521511460","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu